  "2026-09-08T05:41:23.494Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: full 2658-item all-status inventory and live search test sandbox TMPDIR repository git; pm-ay3l0p fixes inherited PM source variables, pm-p5u6 tracks temporary footprint. Neither owns Git ancestor discovery through TMPDIR. New bounded runner guard follows the observed Sep 8 coverage failure."
  "2026-09-08T06:41:04.469Z","harness:codex","Reproduction cleanup evidence: the managed extension registry changed only its generated timestamp, with identical package entries. Test-created Git fence changes were restored and the two precisely identified synthetic merge receipts were quarantined from the runtime evidence set. Final verification uses an external scratch root without a tracker ancestor."
  "2026-09-08T06:55:58.650Z","harness:codex","Final verification: full sandbox coverage completed successfully with --maxWorkers 4; all exact coverage thresholds pass. Static gates, docs/skills, SDK boundary/parity and graph/record-integrity gates pass. Earlier environmental failures and the resource-contention rerun remain documented; this evidence applies to the final local delivery."
  "2026-09-08T07:09:24.247Z","harness:codex","Hosted correction verified: the two external-root tests explicitly cover skip-build 0 and 1; 24 runner tests pass with inherited PM_RUN_TESTS_SKIP_BUILD=1 and all 95 linked tests pass in that environment. The production guard is unchanged from the 8562-test, exact-100-percent local run. Required defect taxonomy and structured gate evidence are now attached; the developer skill requires the evidence gate after terminal transitions. Hosted code and coverage checks will run on the correction commit."
  "2026-09-08T07:22:02.040Z","harness:codex","Post-closure verification completed: pnpm quality:defect-evidence passes with zero findings, and the entire pnpm quality:static command exits 0 including docs/skills, SDK contracts, all repository assurance providers, tracker-context-quality, graph composition and record integrity. Package-owned changelog generation/check preserve all 2330 current memberships. The corrected item and workspace history streams verify against their current state."
